        "content": "<p>I was quite surprised to see that this proof fails:</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"sd\">/--</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">error: Invalid alternative name `succ`: Expected `unit`</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">---</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">error: Alternative `succ` has not been provided</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">-/</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">theorem</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ohno</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">n</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Nat</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">True</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">induction</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">n</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">with</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">zero</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">cases</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">()</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">with</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">trivial</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"c1\">-- add `skip` on this line and the proof works</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">succ</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">n</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">trivial</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>Should <code>cases</code> refuse to match <code>|</code>s with incorrect indentations?</p>",
